OL,3,GNEWSATen councillors quit after
OL,4,Aleader's fraud conviction
OL,5,
OL,6,FTen Ashfield Independent councillors
OL,7,Fhave quit the party this week following
OL,8,Fthe former leader's fraud conviction.
OL,10,FJason Zadrozny was found guilty of nine
OL,11,Fcounts of fraud and four counts of tax
OL,12,Fevasion last month
OL,14,FHe resigned as leader of Ashfield
OL,15,FDistrict Council the following day, but
OL,16,Fwas later given a seat on the
OL,17,Fauthority's planning committee.
OL,23,APub: 22-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
